00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:28.200
An exhilarating, thrilling chance chance
Uki-uki waku-waku chansu chansu

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:35.080
We have work to do?

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:37.730
That's not funny.

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:39.330
Good, because it's not a joke.

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:43.570
The head of Yorozuya Enterprises
is visiting Planet Baham,

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:47.190
and as last-minute request, the company has
asked the 3WA to be the chairman's escort.

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:49.240
Today's our day off.

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:50.370
Not anymore.

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:54.680
Yorozuya is one of the top five
mega-conglomerates in the galaxy.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.910
Get dressed and head to Baham immediately.

00:01:56.910 --> 00:01:57.910
No thanks.

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:01.750
That's right. It doesn't matter who
this chairman is, a day off is a day off.

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:02.880
If you'll excuse us.

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:03.750
We're going back to bed.

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:04.090
Oh, right. Your bonus.
We're going back to bed.

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:05.190
Oh, right. Your bonus.

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:08.920
The meeting where we decide
your bonus is coming up soon, isn't it?

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:18.190
Leave It To Us!
The WWWA Is a Wonderful Job

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:35.480
Please, come in.

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:38.020
We've been waiting for you.

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:39.820
Please come this way.

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:45.260
Are either of you gentlemen the
chairman who requested our services?

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:50.630
Heavens, no. The Yorozuya Corporation
was founded over 700 years ago...

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:54.260
...and we three come from the families
that have served as executives for generations.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:56.710
I'm Takekawa.

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:57.670
I'm Umeda.

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:59.070
I'm Matsumoto.

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:01.010
So who's the chairman?

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:01.310
That would be me.
So who's the chairman?

00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:02.570
That would be me.

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:11.210
This is Lady Sakurako Yorozuya,
37th chairman of the Yorozuya Corporation.

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:16.730
Since it's founding, our company
has operated under a hereditary system.

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:23.430
Her father, the 36th chairman, passed away
recently, so Lady Sakurako inherited the company.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:24.500
Huh...

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:29.170
We've hired the two of you for today, because...

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:33.710
...Lady Sakurako will be
visiting the town incognito...

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:37.010
...and we'd like you to protect her.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:39.180
Incognito, huh?

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:42.080
Is there any particular reason for this trip?

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.920
Yes. The truth is that I...

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:46.610
I...

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:50.480
I've always wanted to see
the hustle and bustle of a big city!

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:10.540
What? What's that? Look! Oh, my!

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:19.790
The President will be holding
a dinner party today, at five o'clock.

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:24.160
Lady Sakurako will be meeting
with the President at this event.

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:31.670
Yorozuya Enterprises has been contracted to
handle the entire Baham redevelopment project.

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:37.260
Therefore, this meeting with the President
at the dinner party is very important.

00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:43.900
Huh? Where are we?

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.950
Are we in a foreign country?

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:48.070
It looks so different!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:52.550
Amazing! Just amazing!

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:55.320
Huh? That's incredible!

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:56.160
Wow...

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:56.830
Stop that.
Wow...

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:57.390
Stop that.

00:04:57.390 --> 00:04:59.830
Everyone's giving us weird looks!

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:02.300
Aren't you supposed to be incognito?

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:05.100
Instead, you're sticking
out like a sore thumb.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:08.340
You're right. I'll be more careful.

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.170
My! What could that be?

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:11.610
Hey!
My! What could that be?

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:12.640
Hey!

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:13.640
Smells delicious.

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:14.110
Welcome!
Smells delicious.

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:14.770
Welcome!

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:17.010
Would you like one, miss?

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:18.710
Yes, please!

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:27.890
I've never eaten while walking
around on the street before.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.580
It's delicious!

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:34.260
Y-You know you need money for that, right?

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:40.760
If you eat something, you have to pay cash for it.
Understand? You can't use your card at a stall.

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:43.970
You two are funny.

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:48.440
You've got the wrong idea about me.
I'm not some clueless princess.

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:50.470
"You know you need money, right?"

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:53.910
Here you go, sir.

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:58.990
Stop kidding around, miss.

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:01.960
What are you trying to buy, a house?
There's no way I can make change for this!

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:05.490
Yeah, you're pretty clueless.

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:08.660
Hey, cutie.

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:13.230
Stop eating that crap
and come hang out with us.

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:17.040
Looks like this is your first time in the city,
so we'll show you some fun places.

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:21.030
Sorry, boys. She's way out of your league.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:25.250
Someone with a face as pretty as yours
shouldn't be so harsh.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:27.320
Really? You think I'm pretty?

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:30.090
Get on. I'll give you a tour of the city.

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:32.490
Enough already! Get lost.

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:40.730
Lay a hand on me, and you're going to get it.

00:06:41.030 --> 00:06:43.460
Oh, is that so?

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:44.570
Watch out!

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:47.000
Why you!

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:58.940
T-That's why you have to be careful!

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:00.710
What am I, some wild animal?

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:04.350
Honestly, you're so short-tempered.

00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:06.620
I can't stand guys like them.

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:07.820
Next time I see them, I'll...

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:08.120
Um...
Next time I see them, I'll...

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:08.780
Um...

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:11.920
I have to... Uh...

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:16.690
I can't believe this!

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:20.190
We're more like babysitters than bodyguards.

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:21.660
It's so unfair.

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:26.110
Just because that idiot was born as
the Yorozuya Corporation's heir,

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:28.470
she gets to live a life of luxury
and never has to work.

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:31.180
And then, just look at us!

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:35.680
We work like dogs, made to follow
our boss's unreasonable orders.

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:38.690
Forget a life of luxury,
we can't even get a day off!

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:39.620
Yup, yup.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:42.160
How could something so unfair be allowed?!

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.060
I agree!

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:47.430
We have to stand up and fight
against such absolute injustice!

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:48.700
That's right!

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:49.760
By the way,

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:51.000
isn't she taking a little too long?

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:51.400
Yeah, she is.
Isn't she taking a little too long?

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:52.160
Yeah, she is.

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:00.040
She's gone.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.410
Yeah.

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:02.740
Gone?!
Gone?!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:04.770
No way!

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:09.480
That little twerp!

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:16.450
I can't do anything with
two guards hanging around.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:21.560
W-What did you say?!

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:24.400
We searched the area right away, but...

00:08:24.930 --> 00:08:27.070
What do you think we hired you for?

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:29.100
Y-Yes, we understand.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:31.140
We'll go find her now.

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:32.070
Wait!

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:34.400
You stay here.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.040
M-Me?

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:40.580
We're expecting a few visitors
before the dinner party.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:44.220
You'll act as her double until she gets back.

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:47.860
Huh? We can't let this
vulgar woman act as her double.

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:49.220
What did you say?

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:52.790
Well, it's not like the other one is any better.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:57.270
Fortunately, none of our guests know
what Lady Sakurako looks like.

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:59.390
It can't be helped.

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:01.190
You'll do it, right?

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:03.200
Fine!
Fine!

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:09.340
I can't believe it. I'm so
much more proper than she is!

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:14.010
This is amazing!
Real silk with platinum stitching.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:20.740
Chances like this don't come very often,
so I'm gonna fully enjoy feeling rich!

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:24.050
Who is it?

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:25.690
I brought some beverages.

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:26.090
What's the password?
I brought some beverages.

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:26.830
What's the password?

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:29.030
"The king's whiskers are those of a cat."

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:30.260
Come in.

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:37.900
Ah! I was just getting thirsty, too.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:40.470
Er, I mean, might I have something to drink?

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:45.250
No, not yet.

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:46.110
Huh?

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:50.110
What the?

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:02.800
It would be tragic if anything were poisoned.

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:06.800
We only serve Lady Sakurako
food that has been inspected.

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:08.000
All done.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.230
Here you go.

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:15.140
No, thank you. I'm full.

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:16.340
I see.

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:18.180
Then, please go to the other room.

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:22.850
Please have every document stamped
before the visitors arrive.

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:26.860
All of them?

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:28.690
Why don't you guys do it?

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:29.760
Heavens, no!

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:33.260
Since the founding of Yorozuya
Enterprises over 700 years ago...

00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:36.630
...the executives have been
forbidden from doing this duty.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:39.300
Oh, i-is that so...

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:44.300
Ugh, what a pain.

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:48.770
I am so over this!

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.410
What? Yorozuya's daughter?

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.780
Yes, sir. No doubt about it.

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:00.320
Good.

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:06.550
This is the perfect opportunity to get Yorozuya's
redevelopment project contract revoked.

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:08.920
Right, Panther?

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:11.260
I guess.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:15.530
When that happens, my company will have
a chance to get the contract again.

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:19.110
I guess.

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:51.600
Where did that airheaded heiress go?

00:11:54.110 --> 00:11:55.200
There she is!

00:11:57.310 --> 00:11:58.470
Come back here!

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:08.650
Please forgive me, but I'm in quite the hurry.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.090
You're not getting away!

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.470
It's the end of the line.

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:21.740
All right, enough being selfish. We're going back.

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:22.140
It'll be okay. I promise I'll be back
before the dinner party.
All right, enough being selfish. We're going back.

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:25.140
It'll be okay. I promise I'll be back
before the dinner party.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:30.580
You can't stay out here. My partner has probably
gone crazy posing as your double by now.

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:34.250
But I have to see more of the city.

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:36.280
You've seen a ton already!

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:37.850
I don't mean for fun.

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:42.290
I want to see what kind of areas our
company is going to be redeveloping.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:44.990
My, you're serious all of a sudden.

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:47.930
I may not look it, but I'm the
head of Yorozuya Enterprises.

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:49.590
It's my duty.

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:55.670
I'm impressed.

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:58.330
We may have different jobs,
but you're a professional, too.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:14.520
Kei will take care of the company for now,
so I'll take you wherever you want to go.

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:15.320
Really?

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:17.960
Get back!

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:28.360
Go in here.

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:31.310
Hey!

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:33.410
It's one credit per person for 30 minutes!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:34.500
We'll pay when we leave!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:41.520
This looks fun!

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:44.020
Someone's out to kill you, you know.

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:47.190
That's nothing new. It happens all the time.

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:50.420
That's why the executives are so
overprotective, and don't let me go out.

00:13:50.630 --> 00:13:51.890
Hold on!

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.760
You're going to follow me.

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.920
My, it's started!

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.540
Do you shoot them with this?

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:17.350
Ah! I did it, I did it!

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:19.480
Huh, you're pretty good at this.

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:22.420
All right.

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:24.550
Take that! Over here!

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:26.890
I'm going to get you!

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:28.100
There!

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.530
I'll shoot you down!

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:33.660
I did it!

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:44.280
That startled me.

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:46.080
Wow, it's so realistic!

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:47.080
Right?

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:48.650
That was real.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:49.780
He's closing in on us.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:14:58.990
Why you!

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:02.290
This way.

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:07.740
Out of the way!

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:18.500
Persistent bastard!

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:28.420
Don't bother me!

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:30.460
Found you!

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:35.590
Which way to the exit?

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:39.430
My, how wonderful!

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:41.400
This is no time to be impressed.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:44.000
Perhaps this will take us to the exit?

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:46.470
She's pretty sharp sometimes.

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:55.250
Oh, no! Now I won't make it to the
dinner party on time. What should I do?

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:57.550
Don't worry. Just trust me.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:22.700
A dead end?

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:25.300
Get down!

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:39.450
What the?

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:43.160
Yuri. Yuri!

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:44.490
Come in.

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:46.130
She's not going to make it.

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:48.770
Do you suppose something has
happened to Lady Sakurako?

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:50.270
This is our fault.

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:51.760
Yuri. Yuri!

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:55.040
We should have hired more guards.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.430
Let's go.

00:16:56.810 --> 00:16:57.810
But...

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:59.280
Trust Yuri.

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:02.050
Once she accepts a job,
she always finishes it.

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:02.810
Come on.

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:22.760
Panther better have finished her off.

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.940
The President is strict about punctuality.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:31.710
If Lady Sakurako doesn't appear
at the dinner on time...

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:34.750
...Yorozuya Enterprises will lose its credibility...

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.650
...and if worse comes to worst, the contract
for the redevelopment project might be...

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:37.990
Yuri, I believe in you.
...and if worse comes to worst, the contract
for the redevelopment project might be...

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.950
Yuri, I believe in you.

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:56.560
Hey, cutie. Wanna play?

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:02.770
Drive as slowly as you can.

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:08.170
Looks like he did it.

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:14.680
Drive slower.

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:18.190
Even if she makes it in time, switching
girls in front of everyone would be...

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:22.060
That's right. If they found out we
used a double, we'd be done for anyway.

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:24.470
We're pros. We'll figure something out.

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:25.590
But...

00:18:27.230 --> 00:18:29.140
All we can do now is wait.

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:30.100
Yuri...

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:35.700
I guess the leading man should take
his time when making an entrance.

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:44.550
I believe in you.

00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:48.550
It's over.

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:52.290
Yuri...

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:57.400
This can't be...

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:58.800
It's not going to happen.

00:18:58.800 --> 00:18:59.960
Let's just give up.

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:09.610
They're here!

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:19.550
What the?!

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:21.190
Take that!

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:26.430
It's them!

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:27.450
Lady Sakurako!
Lady Sakurako!

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:43.310
Yuri!

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:45.380
Hi! Sorry to make you worry.

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:45.710
Long time no see.
Hi! Sorry to make you worry.

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:46.440
Long time no see.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:04.090
Lady Sakurako!
Lady Sakurako!

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:09.560
See you, Lovely Angels!

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:25.510
Looks like I won.

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:27.380
The President has arrived!

00:20:57.150 --> 00:21:01.090
Well! Thanks to you two, the future
of our company looks bright.

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:02.420
Thank you, thank you.

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:06.390
This is how vulgar girls get things done.

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:09.390
Ah! You got me there.

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:13.770
Hey, what were you going to
do if we didn't make it?

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:16.370
I didn't have to think about that.

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:18.070
I trust my partner.

00:21:18.070 --> 00:21:19.300
Good answer!

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:28.350
Kei, that girl's on TV!

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:29.280
What?

00:21:29.420 --> 00:21:33.250
Today, I am interviewing Sakurako Yorozuya,
the young chairman of Yorozuya Enterprises.

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:38.250
Her company will be spearheading
the Baham redevelopment project.

00:21:39.090 --> 00:21:42.130
Oh, this anchor's a hunk.

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:43.100
Now...

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:46.400
...I'd like to ask you a lighthearted question.

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:50.140
If you were reincarnated as an ordinary girl,
what would you want to do for a living?

00:21:50.140 --> 00:21:53.440
Heh. For a hunk, he sure
asks dumb questions.

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:56.310
Better than him being stupid and ugly.

00:21:56.310 --> 00:21:58.070
If I were reincarnated?

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:01.340
Why, I'd be a 3WA Trouble
Consultant, of course!

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:05.020
It's a wonderful job!

00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:08.010
But, it might not be for me...

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:09.590
Listen to her.

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:10.610
Yeah.

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:12.890
Hey, you two!

00:22:12.890 --> 00:22:14.050
Are you watching?

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:49.730
The mystery began after I fell asleep that time
Ano toki nemuri no ato ni okotta mistuerii

00:22:49.730 --> 00:22:56.240
I was guided by a voice from the future
Mirai kara kuru koe ni michibikareta no yo

00:22:56.240 --> 00:23:02.740
